^SAMPLE = GSM4932542
!Sample_title = RAS-ON-A
!Sample_geo_accession = GSM4932542
!Sample_status = Public on Nov 25 2020
!Sample_submission_date = Nov 24 2020
!Sample_last_update_date = Nov 29 2021
!Sample_type = SRA
!Sample_channel_count = 1
!Sample_source_name_ch1 = pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma cells
!Sample_organism_ch1 = Mus musculus
!Sample_taxid_ch1 = 10090
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell line: 4292
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = cell type: pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = treatment: Untreated
!Sample_characteristics_ch1 = doxycycline induction: +
!Sample_treatment_protocol_ch1 = The 4292 pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma cells with stable Cas9 expression were infected at low viral titers with the CRISPR lentiviral library so that approximately 10% of the cells were infected, and the infected cells were selected with puromycin (1µg/ml) for two days.
!Sample_growth_protocol_ch1 = The 4292 pancreatic ductal adenocarcinoma cell line, which has KRAS expressed controlled by the Tet-ON system, was cultured in RPMI 1640 supplemented with 10% FBS and 1% penicillin/streptomycin, containing 1μg/ml doxycycline.
!Sample_molecule_ch1 = genomic DNA
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = Genomic DNA was isolated using the Zymo-Spin V column (Zymo Research).
!Sample_extract_protocol_ch1 = HiSeq libraries were constructed by one-step PCR amplification following reported protocols (Joung J et al., Nat Protoc. 2017, 12(4):828-863. PMID: 28333914).
!Sample_data_processing = Library strategy: CRISPR screen
!Sample_data_processing = Computational analysis of the libraries was performed using MAGeCK (version 0.5.9.2)
!Sample_data_processing = First, cutadapt (version 2.6) was used to trim primer and other technical sequences from paired-end FASTQ files with the specified options: -j 0 --maximum-length 30 --pair-filter=both -e 0.3 -g GCTTTATATATCTTGTGGAAAGGACGAAACACC...GTTTTAGAGCTAGAAATAGCAAGTTAAAATAAGGCTAGTCCGTTATCAACTTGAAAAAGT -G CCGACTCGGTGCCACTTTTTCAAGTTGATAACGGACTAGCCTTATTTTAACTTGCTATTTCTAGCTCTAAAAC...GGTGTTTCGTCCTTTCCACAAGATATATAAAGC
!Sample_data_processing = Second, the command, mageck count, was run under default options with the trimmed paired-end FASTQ files supplied in the arguments --fastq and --fastq-2 to collect read counts
!Sample_data_processing = Genome_build: Brie mouse sgRNA library (Addgene #73633)
!Sample_data_processing = Supplementary_files_format_and_content: Tab-delimited text files containing raw counts for each sgRNA
!Sample_platform_id = GPL21103
